@@ -7,6 +7,10 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- **macOS: `Config.Background` and `Config.WithBackground(bool)` start the app without taking focus or showing the window.** macOS only; other systems ignore it. Default is off, and then start-up is unchanged. When on, the activation policy is Accessory (windows allowed, no Dock icon) instead of Regular, `activateIgnoringOtherApps` is not called, and the start-up `Show` is skipped. The window, Metal surface and device are still created, and the window is drawn while hidden. A later `Window.Show()` shows the native window and `Window.Visible()` reports the same state throughout. The policy does not change on `Show`.
+
 ## [0.54.1] - 2026-11-08
 
 ### Fixed
